  turnin 597                          -- First Mate Crazz
  accept 599
  accept 576                          -- Dizzy One-Eye
  turnin 599                          -- Fleet Master Seahorn
  accept 604
  accept 587                          -- Deeg, on the top floor
  turnin 610                          -- Catelyn the Blade, upstairs
  accept 611                          -- Gazban swims off the north-west coast, on the northern loop

step Wild Shore: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Every Bloodsail drops Snuff and one of them carries Dizzy's eye; the Swashbucklers walk the shore just north of town. The charts and orders lie in the pirate camp on the Wild Shore, south of Booty Bay.
  collect 3920 quest 604              -- Bloodsail Charts
  collect 3910 quest 587              -- Snuff
  collect 3897 quest 576              -- Dizzy's Eye
  collect 3921 quest 604              -- Bloodsail Orders
  kill 1563 quest 604                 -- Bloodsail Swashbuckler

