step Riding at 40
  only Human
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Randal Hunter teaches Humans at Eastvale Logging Camp in eastern Elwynn Forest, beside Katie Hunter's horses. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour.
  train 4732 optional                 -- Randal Hunter
  vendor 384 optional                 -- Katie Hunter: other colours, 20g

step Riding at 40
  only Skyborne
  zone Elwynn Forest
  when level>=40
  tip At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Skyborne learn it from Genn Fairweather, the stablemaster and riding trainer at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar on Zephras Isle, who also sells the Galestriders: the skyboat to the isle leaves the north side of Dalaran about every five minutes. Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists the Galestriders.
  note "Riding and Galestriders: Genn Fairweather, at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar on Zephras Isle."
  note "Skyboat to Zephras Isle: the north side of Dalaran, about every five minutes."

